@startuml
title Sequence Diagram Menambahkan Data Mata Pelajaran (Tata Usaha)

actor "Tata Usaha" as TU
boundary "UI" as UI
control "Controller" as C
entity "Database" as DB

== Akses Halaman Mata Pelajaran ==
TU -> UI: 1. Akses menu "Mata Pelajaran"
UI -> C: 2. Request subjects page
C -> DB: 3. Get subjects list & confirmed teachers
DB --> C: 4. Return subjects & teachers data
C --> UI: 5. Load subjects page
UI --> TU: 6. Tampilkan halaman mata pelajaran

== Tambah Mata Pelajaran Baru ==
TU -> UI: 7. Klik "Tambah Mata Pelajaran"
UI -> C: 8. Request form tambah mata pelajaran
C -> DB: 9. Get confirmed teachers list
DB --> C: 10. Return teachers data
C --> UI: 11. Load add subject form
UI --> TU: 12. Tampilkan form (nama, dropdown guru, status aktif/tidak aktif)

TU -> UI: 13. Input nama mata pelajaran + pilih guru + pilih status (Aktif/Tidak Aktif) + klik "Simpan"
UI -> C: 14. Handle form submission

alt Data valid
    C -> C: 14.1. Validate form data
    C -> DB: 14.2. Create new subject
    DB --> C: 14.3. Subject created successfully
    C -> DB: 14.4. Get updated subjects list
    DB --> C: 14.5. Return updated data
    C --> UI: 14.6. Success response + refresh data
    UI --> TU: 14.7. "Mata pelajaran berhasil ditambahkan" + tampilkan daftar terbaru
else Data tidak valid
    C -> C: 14.1. Validate form data
    C --> UI: 14.2. Validation error
    UI --> TU: 14.3. Tampilkan pesan error:
    note right
    - "Nama mata pelajaran wajib diisi"
    - "Guru pengampu harus dipilih"
    end note
end

@enduml